  "jei.bastion.info.overwatch_link": "A Hub Connector with a camera and fire control. Shift + right-click a Hub Interface to link it, then put it in a turret's Connector slot. On the hub's map, shift-click that turret and press Take control: you look out from the turret, aim with the mouse and fire with attack. Manual aim ignores the turret's turn speed. Tesla Coils and Repulsor Domes can only be watched. Sneak to let go; taking damage, the hub going offline or the turret leaving the hub's reach also ends it.",
